From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wolf Vollprecht <w.vollprecht@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 17:12:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] centerpose: tensor_rt and triton are runtime dependencies, not
 build ones

Same shape as the isaac_ros_dope change, one dependency wider. isaac_ros_centerpose
builds two targets -- centerpose_decoder_node and centerpose_visualizer_node -- out of
five source files, and between them they include only:

    Eigen/Dense, isaac_ros_common/{qos,cuda_stream}.hpp,
    isaac_ros_nitros/types/nitros_type_message_filter_traits.hpp,
    isaac_ros_nitros_{camera_info,image,tensor_list}_type, message_filters, opencv2,
    rclcpp, rclcpp_components, sensor_msgs, vision_msgs

Nothing from isaac_ros_tensor_rt or isaac_ros_triton. Both are inference backends the
launch files choose between -- isaac_ros_centerpose.launch.py composes the TensorRT node,
the Triton variant composes the Triton one -- and the decoder consumes whichever one's
output topic. It is written not to care: it takes a TensorList and produces a
Detection3DArray.

Because ament_auto_find_build_dependencies() makes every `<depend>` a REQUIRED
find_package, declaring them that way means centerpose cannot configure unless *both*
inference backends are installed, including the one the chosen launch file will not use.
Triton in particular is a large server package to require in order to compile a PnP
solver. `<exec_depend>` still installs them for `rosdep install` and still lets the
launch files find them; it just stops the build from demanding them.

Note that the two are alternatives, so even as exec dependencies neither is strictly
required for every deployment. Expressing that properly needs `<conditional>` or a
metapackage split, which is a bigger change than this one -- but a package should at
minimum not have to *build* against both.
---
 isaac_ros_centerpose/package.xml | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/isaac_ros_centerpose/package.xml b/isaac_ros_centerpose/package.xml
--- a/isaac_ros_centerpose/package.xml
+++ b/isaac_ros_centerpose/package.xml
@@ -43,14 +43,14 @@
   <depend>isaac_ros_nitros_tensor_list_type</depend>
   <depend>isaac_ros_nitros_image_type</depend>
   <depend>isaac_ros_nitros_camera_info_type</depend>
   <depend>isaac_ros_dnn_image_encoder</depend>

   <depend>isaac_ros_tensor_list_interfaces</depend>
-  <depend>isaac_ros_tensor_rt</depend>
-  <depend>isaac_ros_triton</depend>
+  <exec_depend>isaac_ros_tensor_rt</exec_depend>
+  <exec_depend>isaac_ros_triton</exec_depend>

   <depend>message_filters</depend>
   <depend>rclcpp</depend>
   <depend>sensor_msgs</depend>
   <depend>tf2_eigen</depend>
   <depend>libopencv-dev</depend>
